<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Specialty Catalog Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Specialty Catalog Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Specialty Catalog Corp</p>
<p>Nasdaq Stock symbol	     CTLG</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $7.25-$8/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    1.25 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.25 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    4,451,666</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 GKN Securities</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  187,500 shrs</p>
<p>Business: direct marketer targeting niche consumer product categories.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: intends to apply net proceeds to repay $5.9 million of the company's senior indebtedness, including $1.5 million to pay down the outstanding amount under the revolving credit portion of the senior indebtedness.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s:   Dec 30		Dec 31</p>
<p>				   1995		  1994</p>
<p>   - Net Sales	     $42,568	    $38,179</p>
<p>   - Net Income		 $522	    $12,789</p>
